.TH DEBUG_FLUSH 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
debug_flush \- Engine\-internal: draw the queued shapes and text if draw is true, then empty the queues
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdebug.h\(dq
.BI "void debug_flush(bool draw);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Engine\-internal: draw the queued shapes and text if draw is true, then empty the queues. Called once per frame by engine_run() after the scenes render; games never call it.
.SH MODULE
debug (src/engine/debug/debug.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_run (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
